================== ADVERSARIAL VERDICT (kps-S2-wf) ==================
MAP: arc i->j iff snrm((v_i - v_j)*tau) > 0 (sign of difference-speed signed residue).
SANITY: n=6 break REPRODUCED under this exact map -> S=(1,2,3,4,5,7), tau=5/14,
  valid=True, score=(1,2,2,3,3,4), c3=6, is_SC=False. So map is faithful (NOT SC-forcing by bug).
