PASS B all-crossings: n3=199815 / n4=139199 / n5=49960 valid; ALL SC; realized classes 2/2,2/4,4/12 (all SC ones).
PASS C EXHAUSTIVE off-grid (every M2 tournament over ALL tau, interval-midpoints): 0 non-SC at n=3,4,5.
PASS D sporadic/non-unit/covering/tight: 0 non-SC.
PASS E reflection: T(1-tau)==T(tau)^op on all 84505 valid configs; AND each T~T^op (so each is SC).
LARGE-SPEED SAMPLED (separate file): speeds up to 1e6, prime tau-denominators,
  ~802,669 valid configs sampled at n=3,4,5; NON-SC = 0.
CONCLUSION: claim HOLDS (true) at n=3,4,5. VERIFIED-by-exhaustion within speed-range
